Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Node Exporter Not Accessible
Problem: Prometheus cannot scrape metrics from Node Exporter

Solution:

# Check if Node Exporter is running
sudo systemctl status node_exporter

# Check if port is open
sudo netstat -tlnp | grep 9100

# Check firewall rules
sudo firewall-cmd --list-ports

# Test connectivity from Monitor Server
telnet <VM_IP> 9100
Issue 2: Alerts Not Firing
Problem: Alert rules are not triggering alerts

Solution:

# Check if rules are loaded in Prometheus
curl http://localhost:9090/api/v1/rules

# Verify rule syntax
promtool check rules /etc/prometheus/rules/vm_health_rules.yml

# Check Prometheus logs
sudo journalctl -u prometheus -f
Issue 3: Webhook Receiver Not Getting Alerts
Problem: Alertmanager is not sending alerts to webhook

Solution:

# Check Alertmanager configuration
sudo cat /etc/alertmanager/alertmanager.yml

# Test webhook endpoint
curl -X POST http://localhost:5001/webhook -d '{"test": "message"}'

# Check Alertmanager logs
sudo journalctl -u alertmanager -f
